{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "a8991ed3b934538110ad737d05a3e35b3ddd4cad70148bb23c452d0e14b831ca", "ja": "二つの輝き", "zh": "两道光芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bb040702f4863374e5d186678552fa179fb085b88762a2cabc2ec3d154cf5c3f", "ja": "公演は大盛況！　天体公演の新たなツアーは\n順調な滑り出しを見せている。そんなある日\nメンバー達に『Sunshine Rhythm!』\nからメッセージが届く。温かい内容を読み、\n笑顔になる一同なのだった。", "zh": "演出大获成功！天体公演的新巡演开了个好头。\n某天，成员们收到了来自《Sunshine Rhythm!》的消息。\n大家读着温暖的内容，脸上都露出了笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "363535ab229e27ae65174134d577890dcb31502b4aa62fcc965b55dfddfc2d93", "ja": "（『ソル』の開演から、数日が経った。\n世間は、新たな天体公演の話題で持ちきりだ）", "zh": "（从《索尔》开演至今，已经过去几天了。世间的话题全都围绕着这场新的天体公演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6a7a872f5fd431e23c0ddb8a69ac17b3c437e46f32d19ab506560b520abd4998", "ja": "（あのゲリラライブがSNS上で噂になったことも、\n大きな追い風になっている……）", "zh": "（那场突袭演出在社交平台上成为话题，也成了强劲的助力……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "509fd84c9a88a2117704d009fe53e3c64bf3e094fe070f4465a637b0a5c10136", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃん！　おつおつ～。亜美たちツアー中\nだけど、次の天体公演の準備って、もうやってるの？", "zh": "啊，哥哥！辛苦啦～虽然亚美她们现在正在巡演，但下一场天体公演的准备，已经开始了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e412068b3597f1a9ce6242b89c42d6f1b74d350beacfccc615c2654214475ab2", "ja": "お疲れ様。進んではいるよ。\nまあでも、その前に次は、劇場での公演かな。", "zh": "辛苦了。还是在推进的。\n不过在那之前，下一场应该是剧场公演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "0fa60fde2aaad897e711deae5f5867a3b0ea3f33829d3080d71d2c664986b087", "ja": "今、ミキたち噂になってるみたい。\nこのままみんなで盛り上がっていきたいよね。", "zh": "现在好像到处都在传美希她们的事。\n真想就这样和大家一起继续热闹下去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "65d6e60f77056578dfa4a3d00da5186869059aa9dc7d240d34ff1b56f0eec740", "ja": "鉄は熱いうちに打て、ってね。\nここで打てる追加施策、何かあるかしら……。", "zh": "所谓趁热打铁嘛。现在还能采取什么追加措施呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "92eb742cf065a6a32f4976bfa745907ced05b37947cc4d4c63e685e8617b2fa3", "ja": "律子たちは、自分のツアー公演に集中してくれ。\nそれが何よりの盛り上げになるから。", "zh": "律子你们只要专心做好自己的巡演公演就行。\n因为那才是最好的造势方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "5cb7f70709897f67d484502788430e1aa328d99b3f522901efbb8ca9a5189834", "ja": "私たち、ちゃんとできてましたか？\nこんどの劇場の宣伝とか……。", "zh": "我们做得还好吗？\n这次剧场的宣传什么的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8ed92ee384cd58b4c3e5c23e18640cdd192f04e9b6965500fbc32adf73f1fae0", "ja": "もちろん。注目度がすごく高まったからな。\nみんな、本当によく頑張ってくれた！", "zh": "当然。关注度可是大幅提升了呢。\n大家真的都非常努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "13135d45fd2640ef23e788a6575dd5334dec03d2942e50ad955dfeec76294ae4", "ja": "えへへ♪　真美、劇場が始まる前に言われたかんね。\n後輩たちの余計なお世話を焼いてくれ、って。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 剧场开场前，有人拜托真美多为后辈们操操心来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "df1529e67ceb22561c989682ea62111212b565d5863588baee0bfca04a829ad7", "ja": "亜美は、みんなと遊んでって言われたよ。\nそれと、いいお手本になってって。", "zh": "有人让亚美和大家一起玩。\n还让亚美做个好榜样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b35e2462c7f7870327bad8f55734c4314d74f00aa979a32439073e87764676ca", "ja": "……そんなことも言ったっけ。", "zh": "……我还说过这话来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "b1c8a6a24142fe62d536de0606b1a956f11686e89e5b54676eb56faa13972a14", "ja": "私は……えへへ♪\n後輩のみんなに甘えてもいいよーって！", "zh": "我……嘿嘿♪我对所有后辈说过，你们可以尽管依赖我哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "d39e121b942ea5496633163665a701627c0f89c3c9aff2aae7f75e7efd6b1af0", "ja": "ミキはー、なんでも好きにしていいよって言われたの♪", "zh": "美希呀——有人对我说，什么都可以随心所欲地做哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "963cb2aaa729278f7aa9c53bce4ea140324371eb55b584fe310d36f4f8e36e57", "ja": "えーっ、なんかミキミキだけズルくない？", "zh": "诶——总觉得只有美希美希这样很狡猾吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1518ed0fcd9ad567f5b0115206220377eafadc961fd3ce1baa1d657ff7524906", "ja": "ちょっとニュアンスが違う気がするんだけど……。", "zh": "总觉得意思有点不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "5221b33eb4af193382fde2fc57a330dcf306e0c1c52ede221b7131ed710d293e", "ja": "でも亜美も、こないだ言われたもんね～。\n全力で、好きにイタズラしていいって！", "zh": "不过亜美前几天也被这么说过嘛～  \n说是可以尽全力，随心所欲地恶作剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "51cd43b2e9e7a4ea94923de331fa3e9ac0f59f6c631aa51348ed56de02dfdeb2", "ja": "あ、いやそれは、この公演での話で、\nものの例えというか……！", "zh": "啊，不是，那是说这场公演的事，\n或者说……只是打个比方……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1018_se", "source_sha256": "fe3717207ce5d1c8e10b268556c1e8bd5494da192acec1ce8de4f21f34ba52b8", "ja": "ピロリン！　×5", "zh": "叮铃！　×5", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "6c7b323ce9b75c96b9f6e68fa08f9502b1f409559559de3ac042d99552b343a3", "ja": "あら？　一斉にメッセージ……？", "zh": "咦？怎么突然一齐收到消息……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "eb8e170fca8376d6db41aaddf6dddb892b8d35109fa5bba9b1c66feb9a0bc298", "ja": "あっ！　これ……\n『Sunshine Rhythm!』のみんなから……。", "zh": "啊！这个是……\n“Sunshine Rhythm!”的大家发来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "12d050ec8930e0c1ce03ef34aacb770eff5f46e1cb229c85dd2c5ae8cddf1247", "ja": "「私たちのバトン、受け取ってくれてありがとう！\n素敵なライブでお客さんもお腹いっぱいだね！」って！", "zh": "“谢谢你们接下了我们的接力棒！\n精彩的演出让观众们也大饱眼福了呢！”这样写着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "b7424149ded4dd80cf548109936958a785edbded7db0dbd70583e2be7a87ef9a", "ja": "「やよいちゃんの太陽～♪　カッコよく輝くよ～♪」\nって……えへへ！", "zh": "“弥生妹的太阳～♪帅气闪耀～♪”\n这样……嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "0cc190741dad0c32ca6561fc1ef1fe32f4192942edb3cdd46ec6090856cf2586", "ja": "「今度の公演にはオフの日程が合うみんなと一緒に、\n観に行きますね。ドライブも兼ねて♪」……ふふっ。", "zh": "「下次演出，我会和休息日刚好对得上的大家一起\n去看的。顺便兜兜风♪」……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "e2e16a1ce6a88bc126e6b4f46411debf760fe70dc3f7386d18b6d0e1c2acab93", "ja": "「わたしたちも、がんばっちゃいまーす。\n絶対見に来てくださいね～！」……ふーん♪", "zh": "「我们也会加油的～\n一定要来看哦～！」……哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6429fc293fb7e878f3d8214c8ba14b7d94d8742f68425b41ab76d96c42a955d8", "ja": "どうやら『ソル』の光は、\n劇場にもしっかり届いてたみたいだな。", "zh": "看来『索尔』的光芒也确实照到了剧场里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "1fb34f3e0df7232876d4506f456f600f6ef6baf72c6feef423d097e261500fc7", "ja": "うっうー！　やりましたー！\nなんだか、心がポカポカしてきちゃいますね♪", "zh": "呜呜——！成功啦！\n不知不觉间，心里也变得暖洋洋的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "c9eca7ea4768bc4d1847364bc7d6f456df56c6f07dc1e98b8039221abfffa861", "ja": "ふふっ……ますます気合い入っちゃいました。\nまずは私たち、『ソル』のツアーを成功させましょう！", "zh": "呵呵……我更有干劲了。\n首先，让我们成功举办『ソル』的巡演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1028_011ami", "source_sha256": "505e76cc1ee13d45fa9aab3ceb5b049785ad5176217096146d93bc79ea8b2b05", "ja": "じゃあ、次のゲリラライブの作戦立てちゃおっか？\n今度は兄ちゃんと一緒に！", "zh": "那我们来制定下一次突袭演出的作战计划吧？\n这次和哥哥一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "14d613bd0b75a89978555d3f7bfa58334fcaa28d7abcf4a6901137fec6bc1ee2", "ja": "……そうだな。それも悪くないか！\nあ、今度はこっちが社長たちを誘おうかな。", "zh": "……也是。那样也不错嘛！\n啊，下次换我去邀请社长他们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "11c009ffc0fa5f97b6f43f3397981203c5f9991ea091dce63b358de2bfe0c792", "ja": "ふふっ、みんな味を占めちゃったみたい。\nその代わり、忙しくなりそうですけど。", "zh": "呵呵，大家好像都尝到甜头了。\n不过，这样一来可能会忙起来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1031_011ami", "source_sha256": "5eb63d4986eccc31e1e6397b2c2b77274f7fb62d55baa392d74b9f41d0bf5f8c", "ja": "バッチコイだよー！　ね、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "尽管放马过来吧——！对吧，哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "4d9e3294f20c255012a5a0612c6334bbd43e9f347a992b07f68503ea5e8439a5", "ja": "（その熱を一度も弱めることなく、\n最高潮を駆け抜けていく、『ソル』……）", "zh": "（《索尔》……在这份热度丝毫未减的情况下，一路冲向最高潮……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0324_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0324_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "96ade5f2cc0c2711a4ba2cd21a6bd2808e1db03dda2c8366195e59d3fe8f266b", "ja": "（これぞまさに、天体公演の\nもう一つの太陽！　確かに見せてもらったぞ）", "zh": "（这才正是天体公演的另一颗太阳！确实让我见识到了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
